## Critical Notes
<critical>
- ALWAYS validate ELF files before loading
- NEVER exceed memory constraints
- Use async I/O for file operations
- Implement proper compression
- Generate unique image IDs
- Track memory usage
- Handle all error cases
- Validate page sizes and counts
</critical> 